    "lunch": "Grilled chicken breast (6-8oz) or lean ground beef (6-8oz), served with 1.5 cups cooked brown rice or quinoa, and a large serving of mixed steamed vegetables (e.g., broccoli, carrots, green beans).",
    "dinner": "Baked salmon (6-8oz) or lean steak (6-8oz), served with 2 medium baked sweet potatoes and a large mixed green salad with olive oil and vinegar dressing.",
    "snacks": "Aim for 2-3 substantial snacks per day: Protein shake (2 scoops protein powder, milk/almond milk, 1 banana), 1 cup full-fat Greek yogurt with 1/2 cup berries, a handful of almonds (1/4 cup), 2 rice cakes with 2 tbsp peanut butter, or 1 cup cottage cheese with pineapple."
  },
  "estimated_calories": "2900-3000 kcal per day"
}
